check 1
# Save channel after picking items: a healing potion and a gold pile on
# the ground next to the Amazon (poke item, the game's own creation path),
# the shared input walks to the unit of type 4 nearest the frame centre and
# clicks it at frame 10. Save and Exit after frame 100; the written .d2s
# (item sections: the item the cursor holds, the gold in the stats) is
# compared byte for byte.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md, specs/formats/d2s.md.
name save-items-ama
save SavAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 100
seconds 300
channels save
at 4 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 4 poke item hp1 @x+2 @y
at 4 poke item gld @x+2 @y+3
input frame 9; move 400 300; frame 10; clickunit 4 *
